   "citation": "CDIAL[10511]",
   "evidence": "CDIAL 10511 yuṣmad describes the t-initial paradigm remodeled with tvam: Hindi tum, Nepali timi, Gujarati tame and local Gawri tha, Torwali twa, Indus Kohistani/Chilisso/Palula tus. Lahnda/Punjabi tusā̃ is explicitly in the paradigm. This does not make a short tV singular form automatically a plural reflex.",
